# VibeParty relay (optional)
#
# Leave empty and a party syncs the YouTube tabs of ONE browser — enough to try it out.
# To watch with friends on other computers, run the relay (`bun run relay`, see README → VibeParty)
# and point the extension at it. Remote relays MUST use wss:// (the extension refuses plain ws://
# except for localhost, because an unencrypted relay would leak every room code and chat message).
#
#   WXT_VIBEPARTY_WS_URL=wss://relay.example.com
#   WXT_VIBEPARTY_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8787     # local testing only
#
# Copy this file to .env, then rebuild (`bun run build`) — the value is baked in at build time.
WXT_VIBEPARTY_WS_URL=
